      "Title": "AAMotion.AASmartArrayWrapper",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.AASmartArrayWrapper.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Unified smart array wrapper - supports automatic type conversion for int/float/double/long</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.AASmartArrayWrapper.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">Design Pattern: Strategy Pattern</p>\n<ul sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.AASmartArrayWrapper.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.AASmartArrayWrapper.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">Automatically selects appropriate read/write strategy based on data type</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.AASmartArrayWrapper.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">Supports four data types: Int (32-bit), Float (32-bit), Double (64-bit), Long (64-bit)</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
