      "Title": "AAMotion.ParameterTypeConverter",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ParameterTypeConverter.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Parameter type converter - handles type conversion for controller parameters</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ParameterTypeConverter.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">Core functionality:</p>\n<ul sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ParameterTypeConverter.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ParameterTypeConverter.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">All data in controller is stored as int (32-bit)</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ParameterTypeConverter.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">float: uses IEEE 754 encoding in int</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ParameterTypeConverter.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">double/long: requires additional commands to get full 64-bit value</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ParameterTypeConverter.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\">Automatically detects type and converts (based on XML metadata or cache)</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
